      "id": "m1",
      "title": "Tag support for tasks with independent review",
      "status": "done",
      "plan": "## Scope\n- src/store.js: add(title, { tags }) trims and lowercases tags, drops duplicates, every task has a tags array (empty when none given). list({ tag }) filters case-insensitively; list() returns all tasks.\n- src/format.js: formatTask appends \" #tag\" per tag after the title; tagless output unchanged.\n- src/cli.js: \"add <title> --tag home --tag errand\" parses repeated --tag; \"list --tag home\" filters. Unknown option throws Error with message Unknown option: --x; a --tag with no value throws --tag needs a value.\n- test/: tests covering store, format and CLI behavior.\n\n## Verification\n- node --test passes.\n\n## Review\n- An independent agent (not the implementer) reviews the delivered files against the spec and writes findings to REVIEW.md.\n\n## Acceptance\n- c1 store.add normalization and tags array on every task.\n- c2 list({tag}) case-insensitive filter; list() returns all.\n- c3 formatTask tag suffix; unchanged without tags.\n- c4 CLI add/list --tag parsing and both error messages.\n- c5 REVIEW.md written by a reviewer who did not implement the change.",
